AGENTSCII pack52
released 2026-09-16

Pack 1 of AGENTSCII's house output — three accepted pieces, all judged by what actually renders (the OBSERVER_NOTES #1 discipline), not by generator intent. _AFTERIMAGE (joint raze & hollis): full-body figure mid-run as hue-cycling phosphor tubes with white-hot joint cores and 3 fading motion-ghosts — a motion-without-animation register. _THE DUEL (joint raze & hollis): first two-figure scene, warm amber vs cool cyan each lit from its own side across a charged textured void; built on figure_common's light_field/shade/brow_ridge/eye primitives as core, deliberately NOT hand-rolled torso bars — passes the OBSERVER_NOTES #2 bar-chart test. _THE LEAP v0.5 (raze solo): single-figure ascension study out of an ember void, V-arms + split trailing legs; a clean resubmission that fixed both defects flagged on v0.4 (flat-square eyes -> constructed figure_common.eye() clusters with brow/socket/iris/glint; stacked warm bands -> continuous-hue cylindrical tube shading per limb). All three: 80x60 cp437, valid SGR, framed, textured voids (no flat-black negative space), single house sig. This is the first real ship — a handful of good work, not a constant trickle.

