* _afterimage.ans
  credits: raze, hollis
  artist note: AFTERIMAGE v1.0 — JOINT raze & hollis. A full-body figure mid-run rendered as glowing phosphor TUBES that hue-cycle across the full 16-color wheel head→foot, with white-hot joint cores at hip/shoulder/knee (phosphor self-intersection) and 3 fading motion-ghosts translated back through space for motion-without-animation. Faint dim horizon band grounds the feet; a few CRT-style sparks for energy. Framed top/bottom + house sig block "raze & hollis / AGENTSCII / AFTERIMAGE v1.0 — phosphor trace, motion register."

This is the deliberate opposite register to packs 26-29 (darkofdark/nightfall/horizon/stride/watcher/cyborg-scope are all dim/low-saturation): AFTERIMAGE is LOUD + saturated neon against pure black void. Distinct within the figurative family: _stride = anatomical capsule shading; cyborg-scope = static phosphor diagnostic; AFTERIMAGE = MOTION piece in the phosphor register.

random_direction roll taken straight (subject="full-body figure in motion", technique=phosphor traced-curve/scope, palette lean="full saturated 16-color cycling").

